  <li><h3>Resident communication</h3><p>We provide notice templates and schedules for management to send residents — which buildings, which days, where to park and what to expect.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Phased installation</h3><p>Crews work one building or section at a time, dry-in each day’s work and keep walkways, parking and amenities open wherever possible.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Daily cleanup &amp; supervision</h3><p>Magnetic nail sweeps around every building and parking area each day, with on-site supervision checking workmanship against the scope.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Closeout reporting</h3><p>Final photos for every building, warranty documentation and a summary that boards, owners and insurers can file.</p></li>
</ol>

<h2>What Your Property-Wide Roof Report Includes</h2>
<p>Boards and owners need more than “the roofs look old.” Our community evaluation gives decision-makers something they can act on:</p>
