<p>Use our <a href="/roofing-tools/roof-cost-calculator/">roof cost calculator</a> for rough planning numbers per building, then rely on the written proposal for the real figures.</p>

<h2>Phased Scheduling That Works Around Residents</h2>
<p>Most residential re-roofs take a day or two per building, but on a community the order of operations is what matters. We typically sequence work so that:</p>
